window.products.push({"id":331165,"name":"Rockarchhubd 30oz Tumbler Gifts for Women, Unique Friendship Gift for Bestie, Gifts for Mom, XL Coffee Travel Mug, Inspirational Tumbler with Leakproo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VU9mDW3jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Rockarchhub Travel Tumbler set includes the following:- 30oz Double-wall stainless steel insulated vacuum tumbler: 7.8” (H)- Laser engraved messages- Leak-proof sliding lid with straw hole- 1 x Straight stainless steel straw with silicone tip: 9” (L) - 1 x Bent stainless steel straw with silicone tip: 8.46” (L) - 1 x Straw washing brush- Bonus surprise gift for women- Gift box**DURABLE**The tumbler is 304 food-grade stainless steel and resistant to scratches and chips. The powder-coated finish improves grip and prevents the outer surface from sweating. Great to use on the go, in the car, traveling, camping, parties, at the beach or at work. Comes with 2 stainless steel straws (one bent and one straw) and a straw brush for easy cleaning. NOTE: HAND WASH ONLY. **INSPIRATIONAL GIFTS**Looking for a gift for a special woman in your life or work gifts for coworkers? This travel tumbler with personalized engraved messages is just what they need. They’ll love the personalised messages and the bonus gift we’ve included. Rockarchhub tumblers are practical, stylish and inspirational. The perfect best friend gifts for women, birthday gifts for mom, sister, wife, daughter, friendship gifts for besties or coworkers.Buy for any occasion: birthdays, Thanksgiving, graduation, or just to say Thank You.Available in four different colors and packed in a stylish kraft paper box ready for gifting.**ENJOY HOT OR COLD DRINKS FOR LONGER**The double-wall design with vacuum insulation helps keep your drinks chilled or hot longer than smaller tumblers. Cold drinks including juice, water, or soda will chill for up to 12 hours, and hot beverages including tea and coffee will remain hot for up to 4 hours. A leak-proof and splash-proof lid ensures you don’t have to worry when taking sips when driving or walking. When you buy a quality product from Rockarchhub, you’re supporting a small business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VU9mDW3jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rockarchhub","source_asin":"B09522T76L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-331165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09522T76L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09522T76L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
