window.products.push({"id":331210,"name":"Banneton Proofing Basket Set (4 pieces) - Premium 10 Inch Oval Bread Proofing Brotform, Dough Scraper, Linen Cloth Liner and Instructions by The Great","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jLLb6ZttL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bake truly spectacular artisan loaves with this 4-piece proofing bundle from The Great Bake Co! Our mission is to help you create healthy homemade breads that are not only delicious to taste, but also a feast for the eyes! A LOAF FOR ALL OCCASIONS - Whether you're a sucker for sourdough or wild about white, you can create any type of bread in your banneton. It will hold 1kg (2.2lb) of dough, producing loaves big enough to feed a hungry family or a party of friends. PREMIUM MATERIALS - Our highest quality materials and craftsmanship ensure a great bake time after time. The banneton is hand crafted from naturally sourced rattan cane which works to draw moisture from your dough as it proves. The end result? A beautifully crusty loaf. Also included is a natural linen cloth which can be used to line the banneton for a smooth finish, or to cover whilst the dough is proving. GREAT FOR GIFTING - Your banneton bundle comes with full instructions printed on an easy-to-read reversible card, making an excellent gift for that budding baker in your life. EVERYTHING YOU NEED - Your 4 piece proofing bundle gives unbeatable value for money, providing you with everything you need to turn your ingredients into impressive creations. WHAT'S INCLUDED? - 10\" oval banneton proofing basket, hand crafted from the finest natural rattan. - Ergonomically designed dough scraper. - Natural elasticated linen banneton liner and cover. - Double-sided instruction card, packed full of proving and care hints and tips. CUSTOMER SATISFACTION GUARANTEE We are committed to providing you with the best quality products and are confident that you will love your Great Bake Co. 4 piece proofing set. However, if for any reason you are not satisfied, we will be happy to provide you with a full refund within 30 days, no questions asked. Buy now with confidence!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jLLb6ZttL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Great Bake Co.","source_asin":"B01M74M813","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-331210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M74M813","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M74M813","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
