window.products.push({"id":331253,"name":"Yeedoox French Lavender Sachets Bags Home Fragrance 20-Pack for Drawer Closet Dresser and Car, Fresh Natural Dried Lavender Flowers Scent for Freshene","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wykvL-VPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. High-Grade French Lavender: 20 sachets are all hand-filled with high-quality natural French lavender dried flowers, without any additives, 100% natural and soothing fragrance, and safe for all family members. 2. Long-Lasting and Elegant Fragrance: We only choose fresh lavender newly harvested every year, and the fragrance is strong and more lasting. When you feel the fragrance fading, crumble the buds with your hands, then the sachets will release a new fragrance, and if you repeat this action often, the fragrance can easily last for several months or even a year. 3. Relax the Spirit & Promote Sound Sleep: Linalool in natural lavender can help people calm and fight anxiety, and if you put some lavender sachets around, they can relax your tense nerves, soothe your emotions and improve sleep disorders. 4.Natural Ability & Moth Away: Oil in lavender buds has a strong fragrance, and you can put the sachets in your closet, shoe cabinet, dresser, drawer, bedside, car, and any other place you like. Moreover, Lavender contains substances that are annoying to moths, which can effectively keep moths away from the vicinity of sachets. 5. Beauty Gift: Each sachet is woven with cloth + gauze, and it is beautiful, solid, and reusable. Give as a gift together with your best wishes to your family or friends, and I believe there is no doubt that they all can feel the beauty of natural lavender.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wykvL-VPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yeedoox","source_asin":"B0BQ3KNPTD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-331253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ3KNPTD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ3KNPTD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
