window.products.push({"id":331303,"name":"Cute Cat Glass Tea Mug / Cup With Removable Strainer / Infuser and Lid - for use with any Beverage - Holds 14 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zf7uxx3uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This cat lover mug holds 14 ounces of liquid and comes in four beautiful colors of white, black, pink and blue. The awesome cat shaped tea maker mug is 3 inches in diameter and 5 inches high. The adorable cat mom mug is perfect for brewing and steeping tea and is commonly used as a regular cup for hot beverages such as coffee, hot chocolate and soup, and cold beverages such as ice tea, juice, milk or water.   This cat teacup contains 3 pieces: the body, a high heat borosilicate glass that is explosion proof and can withstand up to 302 degrees Fahrenheit; the strainer, removable and made of stainless steel; and the lid. The steeper cup lid and base are made of polypropylene (PP) plastic and are non-toxic, BPA-free and have no chemical odor. The lid of the tea maker mug locks into place to ensure it does not leak. How It Works To brew and filter your rich flavored tea, twist off the lid and easily remove the strainer. Place the loose leaf tea or tea bag into the tea pot cup and then put the stainless steel strainer back on. Pour hot water through the strainer into the cup and let it steep. Enjoy drinking your tea while the strainer prevents any leaf debris from getting through.   To enjoy a lighter tea, twist off the lid and keep the strainer on. Place the loose leaf tea or tea bag on top of the strainer. Pour hot water over very slowly, then remove the strainer with the tea on top. Specifications Colors: White/Black/Pink/Blue  Size: 3 inches diameter by 5 inches high  Capacity: 14 ounces  Contains: 1 plastic lid; 1 stainless-steel strainer; and 1 glass cup. As a bonus, we’ve included a cool cat coaster with the cat tail mug.  Not dishwasher proof and should not be heated in a microwave.  Easy to clean, just remove the strainer and wash it under the faucet.   With our customer focused policy, do not hesitate, purchase our novelty cat mugs and you will love them!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zf7uxx3uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adeson","source_asin":"B07CBPXYRB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-331303","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CBPXYRB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CBPXYRB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
