window.products.push({"id":331840,"name":"Romertopf With Juice Grooves, Made in USA Wooden Cutting Board, 16 Inch, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SrhxGSPZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This beautiful cutting board which is made in the United States out of Red Alder will do so many tasks for you. Created to work with the Romertopf cookware brand, this cutting board is durable and trust worthy. When using your Romertopf clay pot it is import that you don't shock the clay with extreme temperature changes. When your Romertopf is done cooking just put the hot item directly on this cutting board. It will not shock your Romertopf and protects your counter or table at the same time. The cutting board comes with juice grooves for convenience during your carving. To finish it off we have indented the sides to all you to pick up the board and Romertopf and carry it to your table to serve from.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SrhxGSPZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Romertopf","source_asin":"B00LO7P2ME","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-331840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LO7P2ME","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LO7P2ME","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
