window.products.push({"id":331842,"name":"EGGBLU Recipe Binder with 25 Full Page Blank Recipe Sheets, 25 Plastic Page Protectors and 6 Tabbed Dividers, 11.5\" x 13\", Red Rooster Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xGkf44eXL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"The Eggblu 3 ring recipe binder is bigger than most recipe binders you can find. Lovely design, too! Make your own cookbook binder filled with family meal favorites and grandma's secret recipes! Collect and organize favorite recipes in this beautiful recipe card binder. Even in this day and age of finding recipes nearly exclusively online, a handwritten or printed recipe in a personalized recipe keeper make it even more special. This full page recipe binder with plastic page protectors and dividers is ideal for the avid cook who loved to see their tried-and-true recipes in a personalized, old fashioned way. A truly personal recipe book to write in your own recipes! Each recipe binder kit comes with 25 double sided full page recipe cards, 25 plastic protective sleeves, and 6 sturdy tabbed dividers. Fill it with your cooking secrets and create a do-it-yourself cookbook as a keepsake, a family recipe binder or as a gift for bridal shower, wedding, or Mother’s day. It is also great as a housewarming present.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xGkf44eXL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EGGBLU","source_asin":"B09GYGFRP8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-331842","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GYGFRP8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GYGFRP8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":331843,"name":"Cooling Duvet Cover King 100% Tencel Bedding, Soft and Breathable, Organic Eucalyptus Comforter Cover 3 Pieces Hotel Silky Bedding Sets 1 Duvet Cover ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ra-u0aWoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MOISTURE WICKING FOR HOT SLEEPER – Perfect choice for hot sleeper. Eucalyptus bedding's fibers are naturally structured, they are highly breathable and can absorb moisture completely and naturally, which is released back to the atmosphere. Perfectly paired, this duvet cover set will keep you in the ideal temperature zone all night, whatever the weather. ECO-FRIENDLY & NATURAL – Our duvet cover set are made from 100% TENCE lyocell from natural sustainably sourced eucalyptus fibers, which is considered to be one of the most sustainable fabrics of modern technology. They're made in small batches in a closed loop process where 99% of all water and solvents are recycled. SOFT & SILKY – Eucalyptus bedding is known as \"the lovechild between cotton and silk\", with soft and comfortable touch. Our bedding is extremely smooth and mild to the skin, which is very suitable for babies and people with sensitive skin. It is not irritating or harsh, only feather like softness, suitable for perfect night sleep. COVER YOUR DUVET & WASHING INSTRUCTION – Ruffle duvet cover with hidden zipper closure and 8-corner ties to keep your duvet in fix, made of the finest, highest material for the perfect night of sleep. Only wash in cold water, otherwise the quality of eucalyptus bedding may be reduced. We also recommend that you do not use bleach or fabric softener to prolong the service life of the bedding. Just like your favorite sweater, it gets softer and more comfortable with time. KING TENCEL LYOCELL SET – 1 tencel ruffle duvet cover (104*90 inch) and 2 pillow shams (20*36 inch). No Comforter. The duvet cover with ruffles is really smooth and gentle to the skin, creates a pleasant cool feeling, good for hot sleeper and anyone with any sensitivity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ra-u0aWoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bedding_Dreamer","source_asin":"B0BS96VXFK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-331843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS96VXFK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS96VXFK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":331844,"name":"MineSha Gold Brim Tulle Table Skirt Blue Tutu Table Skirt for Rectangle or Round Table Tulle Tableware for Party,Wedding,Birthday Party Home Decoratio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512Vm+BdobL._AC_.jpg","description":"Material: Made of high-end anti-wrinkle nylon, 2 layers of tulle, soft and comfortable, easy to handle, it comes with anti-wrinkle lining, nice decoration for party. Size: 6ft is 72inches long and 30inches high, 9ft is 108inches long and 30inches high. We recommend that you purchase more than two 6ft table skirts if you want to surround the entire table. Highlight: gold brim, high end, hook on table skirt, easy to install, high quality mesh. Installation: We have a number of Velcro stickers,you only need to fix the Velcro on the table,then attach the table skirt to the Velcro. It can be easily disassembled and be used multiple times. Use: main decoration, birthday party, wedding, holiday party, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512Vm+BdobL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MineSha","source_asin":"B075YN5BKF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-331844","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075YN5BKF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075YN5BKF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":331845,"name":"TENABORT Set of 8 Adjustable Drawer Dividers Organizer Separators Plastic Dresser Organizer for Bedroom, Bathroom, Closet, Office Desk, Kitchen Storag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S5BR0pZWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1.Material：Plastic. Strong Secure Hold, Locks in Place, Foam Ends. Adjustable slide and simple one-click installation with no tools or glues required; foam rubber pads grip strong without leaving any marks or residue. 2.Set of 8. White. Size: 4 inches tall and adjustable from 11 to 17 inches. Expandable retractable design fits most drawers and cabinets front to back or side to side. Organize bedroom dresser drawers and nightstands in adult bedrooms and closets; Perfect for organizing junk drawers, kitchen utensils tool, office desk supplies, craft and art supplies, bathroom clutter and more; Use in home, apartment, condo, dorms, cabins, RVs and campers. 3.Adjustable deep drawers dividers organization instantly unclutter Kitchen, Bathroom, Bedroom, as well as in your dresser, baby drawer, and even in your office. These large drawer organizers can be installed in any drawer of your house. For example, you can install them as silverware and utensil drawer organizers for your kitchen, towel or makeup drawer organizers for your bathroom and even as bookcase and shelf dividers. 4 .Unique design allows easy, Simply lift the lever, inserts place in drawer, adjust to fit, and lock in place; Strong spring-loaded tension locks each divider in place and keeps them upright; Soft foam ends cushion and protect drawers from scratches; Easily adapt compartment spaces to contents with these expandable dividers to create a custom storage solution; Quick and easy to install - no hardware or tools needed. 5.Also can be used for drawer organizer, cabinet dividers partitions, desk drawer dividers, drawer separators, clothes, clothing, underwear, sock. Store and organize socks, women's leggings, sports bras, yoga pants, lingerie, tights, t-shirts, scarves, belts, accessories and more; The dividers expand to desired length and lock into place to keep everything situated; Customize your drawers to perfectly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S5BR0pZWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TENABORT","source_asin":"B07RHRWRYF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-331845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RHRWRYF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RHRWRYF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
