window.products.push({"id":331942,"name":"Flexzion Japanese Vintage Chinese Porcelain Tea Set of 3 Pack - 8oz Traditional Ceramic White Teapot w/ 2 Tea Cups Blue Lotus Flower Style Handmade Ku","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5171s6t1h2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's no secret that drinking tea is good for you. Tea has been an integral part of traditional medicine and is revered as a cure-all in many Asian countries. The Chinese and Japanese have consumed this tea to improve health for centuries. It's even promoted in Western medicine as a way to treat symptoms of the cold and flu. The benefits of drinking tea go far beyond simply feeling better when you're sick. Drinking tea can help protect brain health, improve heart health, and may even prevent certain types of cancer.The all-in-one portable teapot set is a perfect way to start practicing the art of drinking tea, with all the essentials to brew the perfect cup of tea for you and your friend or loved ones. Part of drinking traditional Kungfu tea/ Gongfu tea is admiring the aesthetics of the tea, tea set, and the arrangement, when finished brewing, the tea set turns into a vintage sophisticated piece of decor. Specification: White and Blue Porcelain Lotus China Set White and Blue Porcelain Lotus China Set Material: Porcelain Material: Porcelain Handmade and Painted Handmade and Painted Tea Pot Dimensions (HxL): 3.75\" by 5\" / 9.5cm x 13cm Tea Pot Dimensions (HxL): 3.75\" by 5\" / 9.5cm x 13cm Tea Pot Capacity: 8oz / 150ml Tea Pot Capacity: 8oz / 150ml Tea Cup Dimensions (HxL): 2\" by 2.3\" / 5cm x 5.8xm Tea Cup Dimensions (HxL): 2\" by 2.3\" / 5cm x 5.8xm Tea Cup Capacity: 1.85oz / 55ml Tea Cup Capacity: 1.85oz / 55ml Reminder: The Tea sets are hand made resulting in a Dimention range of 0.04 to 1.2 Reminder: The Tea sets are hand made resulting in a Dimention range of 0.04 to 1.2 Package Content: 1x Chinese Japanese Vintage Porcelain Tea Set Teapot, (White Porcelain Lotus) 100% Handmade Tea pot, 2 Tea cup, Blue and White Asian China Tea Set Home, Wall, Kitchen Decor 1x Chinese Japanese Vintage Porcelain Tea Set Teapot, (White Porcelain Lotus) 100% Handmade Tea pot, 2 Tea cup, Blue and White Asian China Tea Set Home, Wall, Kitchen Decor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5171s6t1h2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flexzion","source_asin":"B08134VX6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-331942","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08134VX6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08134VX6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":331943,"name":"Humidifiers for Bedroom Large Room, ZXBEER 9L Top Fill Ultrasonic Humidifier with 360° Nozzle 7 Color Light Auto Shut-Off, 3 Modes Run Up to 48 Hrs Su","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VOe6IfURL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【9L Large Capacity Humidifiers & Wide Coverage】 Compared with the general models, the newly designed 9L/2.38Gal huge capacity and built-in filtering function humidifier is specially designed for large rooms, which can meet the humidification of a 120-550ft²super large room. Constant moisture for more than 48 hours after adding water. Suitable for family rooms, bedrooms, kitchens, living rooms, and offices. 【Top Fill Humidifier & 3 Mist Settings】You can quickly fill water from the top without opening the main body (also can take out the main humidifier body to fill tap water directly),which is super fast and convenient. Three mist speeds are available for different needs: low, medium, and high speed output. (Maximum mist:300ml/h). The 360° nozzle helps you create a comfortable environment that’s just to your liking. 【12 Hours Timer & Sleep Mode】ZXBEER humidifiers have a timer function; You can set it on 1-12 hours as you like to suit your schedule. LED display will turn off sleep mode; a low noise level of less than 38dB will not disturb your relaxation, learning, working, and sleeping.7-color LED sleeping atmosphere light for you to choose freely. 【Quick Control & Essential Oil Tray】Besides the intuitive touch panel, you can control all the functions remotely within 10 meters. Slide out the aroma tray on the back side of the unit, and drip your favorite essential oils to give your room a lovely scent. Note: Please 1-2 drops of essential oil each time. 【Smart Auto Mode】Built-in humidistat accurately knows the humidity in your room and auto-adjusts to your preset humidity level. The humidifier stops working when the humidity you set is lower than the humidity indoors. Each button press increases by 5%. For example, if the indoor humidity is 62, then the corresponding humidity is 62+5=67. At this time, you need to adjust the humidity to 70% to turn it on. Each adjustment must be greater than 5%. Our humidifier supports 24 hours service online.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VOe6IfURL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZXBEER","source_asin":"B0B1TRVSF8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-331943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1TRVSF8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1TRVSF8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
